  <name>MimOffice Sheets</name>
  <summary>Spreadsheet</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Sheets is a powerful spreadsheet application, with support for formulas, charts,
      and the OpenDocument Spreadsheet (ODS) format. Sheets is part of MimOffice, a
      rebrand of KDE Calligra maintained by XI14.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Hundreds of built-in functions</li>
      <li>Charting and data visualization</li>
      <li>ODS (Open Document Spreadsheet) support</li>
      <li>Import/export of Microsoft Excel formats</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
  <url type="homepage">https://mimoslinux.org</url>
